{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855650/extras/e7e132324687e41357ee8c8882d5e4ed.avif?t=1772692507\" width=1376 height=726 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in the First General Hospital of Yuanwang City, located in the eastern region of a certain country. Two players can take on the roles of the Lin siblings and experience a series of mysterious events in this hospital. The gameplay is designed to fully accommodate dual-player mechanics, featuring encounters such as monster chases, mind-bending puzzles, endless corridors that require both players to gather different clues to proceed, escape rooms, and thrilling dual-player boss battles! Through conversations with other individuals (or creatures) in the hospital, as well as textual and video content, uncover the secrets hidden within this hospital!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Lin siblings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On their 16th birthday, their mother was brutally murdered. While fleeing toward the subway, they were caught in a mysterious &quot;Black Flame Incident&quot; and fell unconscious on the spot. When they awoke, they found themselves in an eerily familiar hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855650/extras/3a1df43a3b357e89459417be4085ea59.avif?t=1772692507\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855650/extras_big/3a1df43a3b357e89459417be4085ea59.avif?t=1772692507 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich puzzles and battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855650/extras/729da96e5fd